---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How Market Europa Moorabbin handles personal information collected through this website." noindex>
  <div class="wrap section">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p><strong>Draft for legal review.</strong> This policy will be completed once the legal entity, ABN and data handling arrangements are confirmed.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>If you subscribe to specials we collect your email address and, if you choose, your mobile number, with the date and source of your consent. If you send an enquiry we collect the details you provide so we can reply. We use website analytics to understand how the site is used.</p>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>To send the specials you asked for, to answer enquiries, and to improve the website. Every marketing email and text includes a way to unsubscribe, and we act on unsubscribe requests within five working days.</p>
    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>Our email and SMS providers, who process it on our behalf. We do not sell personal information.</p>
    <h2>Access and complaints</h2>
    <p>Contact the store on 03 9558 0755 to access or correct your details or to make a complaint.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
